        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "The costume was given to the donor's grandmother (née Nellie Jordan circa 1870) the daughter of Emma Löwenthal and Albert Jordan: it was brought by her maternal relatives the Löwenthals of Aachen on a visit to her family in Manchester sometime between 1875 and 1880."@en ;
